{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49525","headline":"满宫花 二 · 魏承班","name":"满宫花 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒夜长，更漏永。\n愁见透帘月影，王孙何处不归来，应在倡楼酩酊。\n金鸭无香罗帐冷，羞更双鸾交颈。\n梦中几度见儿夫，不忍駡伊薄幸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏承班","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}